<script setup lang="ts">
defineProps<{value:{report:{denominator:number;taxonomy_version:string;aggregation_version:string;excluded_reasons:Record<string,string>;eligibility_requirement_ids:string[];demands:{demand_id:string;demand_unit:string;expression_signature:string;required_solo:{count:number};required_alternative:{count:number};preferred:{count:number};responsibility:{count:number}}[]};facts:{requirement_id:string;expression:unknown;evidence:{quote:string}}[]}}>()
</script>
<template><section class="table-card" style="padding:24px;margin:20px 0"><h2>标准化需求统计</h2><p>固定分母：{{value.report.denominator}} 个岗位 · {{value.report.taxonomy_version}} · {{value.report.aggregation_version}}</p><el-alert v-if="!value.report.denominator" title="暂无正式统计：请在来源页面核对并确认要求，再重新分析；排除原因见下方。" type="warning" :closable="false"/><p>二选一计入“必需可选项”，不同时算作两个独立必需技能。资格条件单列。</p><el-table :data="value.report.demands"><el-table-column prop="demand_unit" label="维度" width="140"/><el-table-column prop="expression_signature" label="要求表达式 / 概念" min-width="260"/><el-table-column label="独立必需" width="100"><template #default="{row}">{{row.required_solo.count}} / {{value.report.denominator}}</template></el-table-column><el-table-column label="必需可选项" width="115"><template #default="{row}">{{row.required_alternative.count}} / {{value.report.denominator}}</template></el-table-column><el-table-column label="优先" width="85"><template #default="{row}">{{row.preferred.count}}</template></el-table-column><el-table-column label="职责" width="85"><template #default="{row}">{{row.responsibility.count}}</template></el-table-column></el-table><h3>资格条件（待本人确认）</h3><p v-for="f in value.facts.filter(f=>value.report.eligibility_requirement_ids.includes(f.requirement_id))" :key="f.requirement_id">{{f.evidence.quote}}</p><el-collapse><el-collapse-item title="排除原因"><pre>{{JSON.stringify(value.report.excluded_reasons,null,2)}}</pre></el-collapse-item><el-collapse-item title="冻结要求与原文证据"><article v-for="fact in value.facts" :key="fact.requirement_id"><blockquote>{{fact.evidence.quote}}</blockquote><pre>{{JSON.stringify(fact.expression,null,2)}}</pre></article></el-collapse-item></el-collapse></section></template>
<style scoped>pre{white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere;font-size:12px}article{border-bottom:1px solid #ddd;padding:12px}</style>
